# The branch "auto-docs" holds nothing but docs/ - the site GitHub Pages serves (Pages: branch "auto-docs", folder
# "/docs"). It is generated (by _RTL-EDITOR and _BIBLE-VIEWER on main), and kept at a single commit by
# scripts/commit-auto-docs.sh on main. See scripts/ensure-docs-worktree.sh there.
.DS_Store
*.log
node_modules/
# Mirrors of scratch files (main ignores "_scratch*" everywhere).
_scratch*
# Mirrors of the sub-projects' own files - not published.
/docs/_*-FROM-MD/_BIBLE-VIEWER/
/docs/_*-FROM-MD/_DELIBERATION-ROOM/
/docs/_*-FROM-MD/_RTL-EDITOR/
# Mirrors of temporary local variants of Perush files (NNNN-book-from-to-title.<number>.rtl.md)
/docs/_*-FROM-MD/פירוש/**/*.[0-9].rtl.*
/docs/_*-FROM-MD/פירוש/**/*.[0-9][0-9].rtl.*
